# Backup debris. `campaign/ad/NARUTO/data/config.json.full.bak` (~84 KB) was written by the
# retired small-range AD-data swap on every small deploy and left behind as untracked noise in
# `git status`. Phase 3 no longer writes it (it renders the AD data model into the run's temp
# dir instead — see campaign/deploy-tasks/phase3-ad.yml), but stale copies still exist on
# servers that ran the old code, and nothing in this blueprint should ever commit a .bak.
*.bak
# The operator's egress allow-list for a contained range (campaign/docs/isolate-testing.md):
# it names the operator's own collectors, so it never enters the public tree.
# testing-allow.txt.example beside it is the template to copy.
testing-allow.txt
